    "body": "fix on `issue/978-open-project-replaces-seelesturm` - ready PR #1022: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/pull/1022\r\n\r\nPinned by the four `mcp_open::` regressions: opening a saved generated Face over a nonempty document (including repeated open) keeps exactly one operation and one posted section; empty files replace old entities and clear history; failed opens preserve the usable document/history/save target; script reload clears old post metadata. The related MCP and scripting suites and app all-targets clippy pass on the published head. Independent review found no issues; merges when reviewed by the maintainer. Moving the reservation from active work to `in-review`.\r\n",
